            <div xml:id="d1421-a1">

                <pb facs="1790" n="1590" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1590"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 1—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Declaration on the Polish Question</hi></head>
                <p>In place of the text of paragraph 2 of the British draft the following text is
                    proposed: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>The British and United States Governments have already taken measures to
                            prevent the alienation to third parties of property of all kinds
                            belonging to the Polish State located on their territory and under their
                            control, whatever the form of this property may be, wherever and at
                            whosoever’s disposal it may be, and without regard to whether it was
                            transferred to someone earlier and exactly when. They are ready to take
                            immediate measures for the transfer of this <pb facs="1791" n="1591"
                                xml:id="pg1591"/> property, as well as vessels of the Polish
                            Merchant Marine, to the disposal of the Polish Provisional Government as
                            soon as possible. To this end they are prepared to discuss with properly
                            accredited representatives of the Polish Provisional Government the
                            manner and time of such transfer.</p>
                    </quote></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
